# Aggressive Negotiations: "Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it and exile that card. Put a
# +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature you control." Each target is judged as the spell resolves (CR 608.2b). On turn 3
# Bot1 targets Bot2 and its own Memnite; in response Bot2 casts Surge of Salvation ("You and permanents you control gain
# hexproof until end of turn"), so Bot2 is no longer a legal target: Bot2 reveals nothing and keeps its Duress, but the
# Memnite, still legal, gets its counter.

